    schema:author <http://localhost:8000/resource/person/1097871> ;
    schema:datePublished "2026-02-19"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "Following the breakout success of the song 'I Can Only Imagine', MercyMe's Bart Millard is living the dream—sold-out arenas, a devoted fanbase, and a thriving career. But behind the spotlight, Bart's past threatens the family he's built, especially the fragile bond with his son Sam. When hopeful newcomer Tim Timmons joins the band for their biggest tour yet, he unknowingly brings a renewed gratitude to Bart's life through their unlikely friendship. Bart soon discovers that Tim carries hardships—and secrets—of his own, forcing him to face his past and repair his relationships with Sam and his wife Shannon before fame costs him what matters most."@en,
        "Setelah kesuksesan luar biasa lagu 'I Can Only Imagine', Bart Millard dari grup MercyMe kini berada di puncak popularitas—tur yang selalu penuh, basis penggemar yang setia, dan karier yang gemilang. Namun di balik sorotan lampu panggung, masa lalu Bart mengancam keharmonisan keluarga yang ia bangun, terutama hubungan rapuh dengan putranya, Sam. Saat pendatang baru yang penuh semangat, Tim Timmons, bergabung dalam tur terbesar mereka, persahabatan tak terduga di antara keduanya membawa perspektif baru dalam hidup Bart. Namun, Bart segera menyadari bahwa Tim juga menyimpan luka dan rahasia tersendiri. Kini, Bart harus menghadapi masa lalunya dan memperbaiki hubungan dengan Sam serta istrinya, Shannon, sebelum ketenaran merenggut hal terpenting dalam hidupnya."@id ;
    schema:director <http://localhost:8000/resource/person/1097871>,
        <http://localhost:8000/resource/person/909318> ;
