    schema:description "Ry, a college student with a chronic illness, escapes to Mallorca for the summer with her mother, where she unexpectedly falls for a local and begins to embrace living in the moment. But as her condition worsens and long-hidden family secrets come to light, everything she has found before summer's end is threatened."@en,
        "Berdasarkan novel kesayangan kita, The Last Sunrise menceritakan Ry, mahasiswi dengan penyakit kronis pergi berlibur ke Mallorca bersama ibunya. Saat dia jatuh cinta kepada Julián dan mulai menikmati hidupnya saat ini, penyakitnya makin parah dan rahasia keluarga yang lama terpendam mengungkapkan semuanya sebelum musim panas berakhir."@id ;
