    schema:datePublished "2026-08-20"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "He's conquered every title in tennis, including an Olympic gold. So why is Novak Djokovic still playing? The Wolf in Winter embeds with the greatest tennis player of all time as he returned to the Australian Open in 2025, capturing the obsession, the preparation, and the fire that won't go out even when there's nothing left to prove."@en,
        "Semua gelar tenis telah ditaklukkan, termasuk emas Olimpiade. Lalu apa yang masih dikejar? The Wolf in Winter mengikuti legenda tenis, Novak Djokovic, di Australia Terbuka 2025, mengungkap obsesi, persiapan, dan semangat yang tetap membara meski tak ada lagi yang perlu dibuktikan."@id ;
